O2EM-NG — Component-Specific Licensing Index
============================================

O2EM-NG is not governed by a single licence for the whole repository.
Different components have different origins and different applicable terms.
This file is an index, not a replacement for the full licence texts.

1. Original O2EM and O2EM-NG project code
-----------------------------------------

The original O2EM emulator and O2EM-NG project code are distributed under the
Clarified Artistic License.

  Full text:        Docs/COPYRIGHTS.txt
  Original notice:  Docs/COPYRIGHTS.txt (top of file)
  Credits:          Docs/CREDITS.md

Original O2EM copyright notice:

  copyright 1996/1998 by Daniel Boris <dboris@comcast.net>
  Developed by Daniel Boris, Andre de la Rocha and Arlindo Oliveira

O2EM-NG modifications and new code: Copyright (c) 2026 Bengt-Ove Peltz.

2. MAME-adapted portions
------------------------

Portions of the Intel 8244/8245 VDC and Thomson EF9340/EF9341 VPP
implementations are adapted from MAME source files that carry an explicit
per-file BSD 3-Clause declaration.

  Full text:        Docs/Licenses/LICENSE.MAME-BSD-3-Clause.txt
  Mapping:          Docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
  Provenance:       Docs/SOURCE_PROVENANCE.md

  MAME 0.289, commit 6512b9adc62a2458c412342268f500f8489edb95
    src/devices/video/i8244.cpp / i8244.h
      Copyright holders: Peter Trauner, Wilbert Pol, hap
      Acknowledgement: Kevin Horton
    src/devices/video/ef9340_1.cpp / ef9340_1.h
      Copyright holders: Wilbert Pol, hap

MAME as a whole is GPL-2.0-or-later, but the referenced files are individually
BSD-3-Clause. O2EM-NG is not affiliated with or endorsed by MAME.

