4. Embedded data
----------------

  i8244/i8245 CGROM     Original O2EM cset.c (Clarified Artistic License);
                         identical to MAME charset_i8244.bin (BSD-3-Clause).
                         See Docs/SOURCE_PROVENANCE.md section 4.

  EF9340/EF9341 charset Original O2EM vpp_cset.cpp (Clarified Artistic
                         License). See Docs/SOURCE_PROVENANCE.md section 4.

5. Assets not distributed
-------------------------

BIOS files, game ROMs, C7010 firmware, commercial manuals and commercial
artwork are not distributed with O2EM-NG. Users supply their own legally
obtained files.

6. Open questions
-----------------

The copyright status of original hardware character data, the rights position
for gameplay screenshots/videos and the Microsoft runtime notice requirements
are recorded in Docs/SOURCE_PROVENANCE.md section 7. Those items are not
presented as confirmed violations.

